- **Meso**: finishes read in [S1]: rock dash or pebble dash, stone, quartz or glass chips of about 3 to 6 mm dashed onto the finish coat before it dries; roughcast with stones in the mix; sand finish floated with a concrete float; smooth troweled; hand textured; sprayed; the skip trowel or lace finish is UNVERIFIED (11 October 2026)
