- **Period**: none (11 October 2026)
- **Joints**: none, sometimes control joints (UNVERIFIED) (11 October 2026)
- **Profile**: skip trowel shows flat topped splotches over a rough base; dash shows random protruding grains; sprayed shows rounded droplets (UNVERIFIED) (11 October 2026)
- **Histogram**: skip trowel gives a spike at the troweled plateau top over a broad lower base; dash gives a positive skew (UNVERIFIED) (11 October 2026)
- **Spectrum**: a bump at the chip or droplet size (UNVERIFIED) (11 October 2026)
