- L4 Meso, paste surface: the local pro concrete module uses a large clouds_2 (scale 2) blurred by 5 then two slope blurs at 0.40 and 0.22 for the slab relief, and a perlin_noise at scale 12 with a slope blur at 0.20 for embedded sand (Copernicus1.md lines 1275 to 1288); in COP, `fractalnoise` > `blur` > Distort by Slope twice; SD: as quoted (11 October 2026)
