- L5 Meso, sealed cracks: a band built from `monotosdf` of the crack mask, flat and slightly raised, for tar-sealed cracks (UNVERIFIED); SD: distance plus levels (11 October 2026)
- **Tileable**: Do Tiled on `shapescatter`, Tile Size on the noises and on `worleynoise` (11 October 2026)
